IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0014.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    05 MONTHLY-TXNS       PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    05 EXTRA-TXN-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM EXCESS-TXN-FEE
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "EXTRA-TXN-FEE=" EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    STOP RUN.
EXCESS-TXN-FEE.
    IF MONTHLY-TXNS > 10
        COMPUTE EXTRA-TXN-FEE ROUNDED = (MONTHLY-TXNS - 10) * 0.75
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'B'
       AND MONTHLY-TXNS > 40
        ADD 15 TO EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    END-IF.
